# Stray SurrealKV test artifacts. SurrealDB's `surrealkv://path` URL syntax
# is interpreted as a relative-path prefix when the URL parser doesn't strip
# the scheme cleanly, creating a literal `surrealkv:/` directory in cwd.
# Filed under `src-tauri/` because tests run from there.
src-tauri/surrealkv:/
surrealkv:/

